Z||000000||FieroKyle||12-16-2001||10:53 PM||||A couple weeks ago I posted a topic called:<BR>"2 Deer Accidents this week!" or something like that. Heres pics of the after math of hitting one at 45 mph, and the other at 55 mph on my winter beater 85 Regal.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/BuickWreckage.jpg"> <BR>Its an ugly site. I just got parts for it so its gonna be repaired. Unfortunatly it has PL-PD. Its off an 83' Regal so its gonna look different.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierokylesig_1.gif">      <P>My Fast 'n Black Car<BR>Kyle - 85' GT||||reg||8
